 "title": "seq events",
 "category": "Framework",
 "author": "Dracyr",
 "description": "The Digitakt mk1's step fire as events, so several mods that change what the sequencer plays combine: generators (does an audio track's step fire; which note it plays) and effects over what every fire plays, audio and MIDI tracks (the step it reads, the trig, its condition, notes, velocity and locks), a step clock per track, and the playing pattern's facts when asked (docs/ADAPTING.md, \"Step-fire events\"). On its own it changes nothing the unit does.",
